750.800e - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled:
A) pizza wrap station (food debris);
B) walkin cooler - shelving and racks (flour/general buildup);
C) dough prep area - shelving (flour/general buildup);
D) cheese sauce dispensers - inner surfaces (food splash);
E) under microwaves (crumbs/dust);
F) under cheese sauce dispensers (crumbs/dust); 
G) hood over pizza ovens - baffles (carbon/grease); 
H) pizza ovens - underneath surfaces (carbon/dust accumulation);
I) dry storage shelves near dish room (general buildup);  and
J) drive thru cooler - tracks and bottom inside (food debris).

Clean non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.
